<h1 class="section-title">Why NoClash exists</h1>
<p class="section-sub">NoClash started as a fix for one problem: two Hampton Roads organizers picking the same Saturday for their fundraiser and the school's fall festival, without either one knowing until it was too late. Here's who built it.</p>

